WEBVTT

01:38.210 --> 01:41.030
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.060 --> 01:43.979
[Episode 28]

02:16.070 --> 02:16.870
Welcome back.

02:17.079 --> 02:17.710
Sir,

02:18.310 --> 02:19.430
what tune is this?

02:19.910 --> 02:21.170
It sounds melancholy.

02:21.800 --> 02:23.800
It's a long-lost tune from the past.

02:23.800 --> 02:24.560
Its name

02:25.720 --> 02:27.120
has long been forgotten.

02:28.470 --> 02:29.800
This melody has lyrics.

02:30.400 --> 02:31.800
Would you like to listen?

02:32.079 --> 02:32.810
Yes, I would.

02:39.500 --> 02:43.190
♫The gloomy, windy, rainy day♫

02:44.079 --> 02:47.280
♫Tears fall gently♫

02:49.360 --> 02:53.240
♫Missing my love who's away♫

02:55.000 --> 02:58.430
♫Melancholy grows silently♫

03:01.080 --> 03:04.430
♫The Qin and Se play a melody♫

03:06.400 --> 03:09.560
♫With the tune echoing♫

03:11.800 --> 03:14.710
♫We crossed paths not accidentally♫

03:17.410 --> 03:21.290
♫My love's still not realizing♫

03:24.190 --> 03:25.910
♫We crossed paths not accidentally♫

03:26.510 --> 03:28.020
♫My love's still not realizing♫

03:30.120 --> 03:30.840
Sir,

03:31.079 --> 03:32.410
this song is beautiful.

03:32.800 --> 03:34.130
Could you teach it to me?

03:38.120 --> 03:40.860
Did everything go smoothly at Liushui Pavilion today?

03:40.860 --> 03:41.579
Yes.

03:41.900 --> 03:42.840
No one noticed that

03:42.840 --> 03:44.700
the Qin player had been replaced.

03:45.240 --> 03:45.840
Good.

03:48.120 --> 03:48.680
Besides,

03:48.680 --> 03:50.190
with your magical spell,

03:50.520 --> 03:51.920
ordinary patrons

03:51.960 --> 03:53.690
couldn't tell the difference.

03:54.520 --> 03:55.120
By the way,

03:55.630 --> 03:57.680
that person showed up today as expected.

03:57.680 --> 03:58.910
He sat in the corner,

03:58.910 --> 04:00.590
thinking I hadn't noticed him.

04:00.590 --> 04:03.120
And he left as soon as the performance ended.

04:03.950 --> 04:05.480
Just as you said.

04:05.680 --> 04:07.480
he was there to keep an eye on you.

04:09.190 --> 04:10.630
Sir, you are a demon.

04:11.080 --> 04:12.960
Why would you fear a mere mortal?

04:13.360 --> 04:15.540
Demon hunters work to eliminate demons.

04:15.540 --> 04:17.240
Of course they have some skills.

04:17.240 --> 04:17.870
We can't

04:17.890 --> 04:19.420
see them as "mere mortals."

04:20.600 --> 04:22.000
He's got plenty of tricks

04:22.890 --> 04:24.310
up his sleeve to deal with me.

04:24.310 --> 04:25.160
What tricks?

04:28.920 --> 04:30.040
Sorry, sir.

04:31.090 --> 04:32.409
I didn't mean it.

04:35.510 --> 04:36.440
I think

04:36.830 --> 04:38.159
he won't give up easily.

04:39.240 --> 04:40.770
Let me take your place again

04:40.880 --> 04:43.040
for tomorrow's show at Liushui Pavilion.

04:43.040 --> 04:43.560
Okay.

04:45.480 --> 04:46.000
Sir,

04:46.530 --> 04:47.990
I'd like a bowl of cold tea.

05:05.630 --> 05:06.430
Ms. Cui!

05:19.810 --> 05:20.470
Stop there!

05:20.800 --> 05:21.310
Get him!

05:22.160 --> 05:22.430
Stop there!

05:22.430 --> 05:22.920
Ms. Cui!

05:28.240 --> 05:29.510
Ms. Cui, don't let go!

05:30.420 --> 05:31.490
Help me.

05:43.150 --> 05:43.780
Xuanye!

05:50.260 --> 05:50.820
Xuanye,

05:51.120 --> 05:51.870
I made it!

05:52.790 --> 05:53.530
What did you do?

05:53.530 --> 05:54.140
Well,

05:54.600 --> 05:55.070
I...

05:55.720 --> 05:56.760
I... Ms. Cui...

05:57.260 --> 05:58.460
It's about Ms. Cui...

05:58.770 --> 06:00.030
Take a breath. No rush.

06:01.100 --> 06:02.540
In a nutshell, the situation

06:02.540 --> 06:04.340
isn't as set in stone as you said.

06:04.390 --> 06:05.790
What you told me last time

06:06.100 --> 06:07.700
wasn't completely correct.

06:07.970 --> 06:08.670
Do you remember that

06:08.670 --> 06:10.130
I could see the white crow?

06:11.790 --> 06:12.940
Just now, because I

06:12.970 --> 06:13.610
saw it,

06:13.940 --> 06:15.500
I saved Ms. Cui.

06:17.510 --> 06:19.370
Well, we were walking on a bridge,

06:19.390 --> 06:20.040
and

06:20.480 --> 06:22.480
Ms. Cui was near the edge of that bridge.

06:22.480 --> 06:23.950
Then a thief came

06:24.100 --> 06:25.090
and made her...

06:38.600 --> 06:39.400
What's wrong?

06:43.270 --> 06:44.159
The white crow.

06:53.480 --> 06:54.310
This bird...

06:55.270 --> 06:55.830
No,

06:56.159 --> 06:57.040
why is this crow

06:57.040 --> 06:58.440
standing on my shoulder?

07:00.270 --> 07:02.510
This is the curse of the white crow.

07:03.120 --> 07:04.160
Curse?

07:06.510 --> 07:07.560
Last time, Mr. Wen

07:07.560 --> 07:09.430
was saved by the Nine Lives.

07:09.800 --> 07:11.720
But now he's dead.

07:14.070 --> 07:15.130
I will protect you.

07:18.180 --> 07:19.060
Banxia,

07:19.750 --> 07:21.190
this is not a joke.

07:22.070 --> 07:23.140
From now on,

07:23.600 --> 07:24.450
you must stay by my side

07:24.450 --> 07:25.270
at all times

07:25.950 --> 07:27.550
until I find a way to save you.

07:28.160 --> 07:28.870
Got it?

07:32.480 --> 07:33.540
I'll do as you say.

07:48.190 --> 07:48.990
What's wrong?

07:51.390 --> 07:52.070
This white crow

07:52.070 --> 07:53.920
is quite heavy on my shoulder.

07:54.310 --> 07:55.240
I can't breathe.

07:56.480 --> 07:57.940
The white crow is a spirit.

07:58.040 --> 07:58.970
It has no weight.

07:59.190 --> 08:00.560
It is heavy!

08:02.630 --> 08:04.190
Fine, it's heavy.

08:05.000 --> 08:06.060
Have some soup now.

08:07.160 --> 08:08.070
I'm sorry.

08:09.120 --> 08:10.450
I moved recklessly,

08:11.480 --> 08:13.430
causing you to worry about me.

08:13.950 --> 08:15.630
Things have developed to this point

08:15.630 --> 08:16.390
because

08:16.630 --> 08:18.660
you've been cursed by the white crow,

08:18.660 --> 08:19.420
not because

08:19.450 --> 08:20.490
you saved Ms. Cui.

08:22.120 --> 08:22.800
Banxia,

08:23.390 --> 08:24.190
remember that

08:24.830 --> 08:25.800
no matter what,

08:26.310 --> 08:28.440
trying to save someone is never wrong.

08:29.170 --> 08:30.190
You might experience

08:30.190 --> 08:31.850
some hardships along the way,

08:31.930 --> 08:33.940
but it'll always end up well.

08:37.240 --> 08:38.510
Is there

08:39.870 --> 08:41.799
still a way out for me at this point?

08:42.909 --> 08:43.750
In this world,

08:44.179 --> 08:45.130
all beings

08:45.150 --> 08:46.190
are connected,

08:46.670 --> 08:47.870
and so are the curses.

08:48.720 --> 08:50.000
But if we can sever

08:50.390 --> 08:52.750
the connection between you and the white crow,

08:52.750 --> 08:54.680
we might be able to break the curse.

08:55.670 --> 08:58.740
The connection between me and the white crow...

09:01.970 --> 09:02.730
You received

09:02.840 --> 09:04.770
the white crow from Chi Wangchuan.

09:05.000 --> 09:07.130
What if you didn't know Chi Wangchuan?

09:09.030 --> 09:09.960
Or if

09:10.530 --> 09:11.720
Chi Wangchuan hadn't taken the white crow

09:11.720 --> 09:13.050
as his companion demon,

09:13.320 --> 09:14.580
would all these things

09:14.600 --> 09:15.800
have never happened?

09:20.670 --> 09:22.670
There's an even more direct method.

09:22.780 --> 09:23.910
Kill the white crow.

09:25.310 --> 09:27.560
But didn't you say that,

09:27.910 --> 09:30.170
as a spirit, the white crow wouldn't die?

09:31.750 --> 09:32.840
That was the case.

09:33.750 --> 09:34.880
But if we draw on

09:34.910 --> 09:36.970
a weapon that can destroy causality,

09:37.020 --> 09:38.350
we'll be able to kill it.

09:38.760 --> 09:40.960
A weapon that can destroy causality...

09:41.960 --> 09:43.750
Is that kind of thing even real?

09:47.010 --> 09:48.540
But whether it will succeed

09:48.750 --> 09:49.680
depends on fate.

09:50.810 --> 09:54.420
♫Just sobered up after a dream, sighing for my life♫

09:54.440 --> 09:57.320
♫In this desolate mortal world♫

09:58.000 --> 10:00.340
♫The other side sees fantasies fading into obscurity♫

10:00.370 --> 10:04.140
♫Is it a blessing or a calamity?♫

10:00.390 --> 10:01.520
Stop overthinking.

10:02.510 --> 10:03.790
It's late now.

10:04.240 --> 10:05.040
Time to sleep.

10:06.490 --> 10:08.440
♫I'm all alone♫

10:08.460 --> 10:10.330
♫Braving the snowstorm♫

10:10.360 --> 10:13.020
♫Struck by sudden amnesia♫

10:10.600 --> 10:12.150
I'm not going anywhere tonight.

10:12.150 --> 10:13.480
I'll stay here with you.

10:13.730 --> 10:16.140
♫Wait until the last peach blossom falls♫

10:14.440 --> 10:16.510
Then sit a bit closer.

10:16.160 --> 10:23.960
♫Glance back with love for 10,000 years♫

10:16.510 --> 10:17.510
Come sit here.

10:24.030 --> 10:26.030
♫If there were no regrets♫

10:26.110 --> 10:28.100
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

10:28.130 --> 10:31.110
♫To illuminate the world?♫

10:31.480 --> 10:35.120
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

10:35.720 --> 10:39.370
♫Before daybreak♫

10:39.450 --> 10:41.390
♫May you have no regrets♫

10:41.420 --> 10:42.990
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

10:43.010 --> 10:46.850
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

10:47.240 --> 10:49.480
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

10:49.530 --> 10:51.380
♫If we luck out♫

10:51.410 --> 10:57.170
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫

10:54.240 --> 10:55.200
That day,

10:55.890 --> 10:57.840
you were deliberately saying hurtful things to me,

10:57.840 --> 10:58.550
right?

11:02.480 --> 11:04.720
Then I'll take it as you didn't mean it.

11:06.100 --> 11:07.740
No matter why

11:07.770 --> 11:09.010
you said those words,

11:12.270 --> 11:13.390
I forgive you.

11:14.690 --> 11:16.620
♫If there were no regrets♫

11:16.640 --> 11:18.640
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

11:17.030 --> 11:17.840
Sorry.

11:18.660 --> 11:21.260
♫To illuminate the world?♫

11:22.040 --> 11:25.730
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

11:26.390 --> 11:30.090
♫Before daybreak♫

11:30.120 --> 11:31.800
♫May you have no regrets♫

11:31.840 --> 11:33.190
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

11:32.270 --> 11:33.750
I've forgiven you.

11:33.210 --> 11:37.450
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

11:37.830 --> 11:40.190
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

11:40.210 --> 11:41.840
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

11:41.870 --> 11:52.050
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫

13:12.000 --> 13:14.760
[Recruitment]

13:16.440 --> 13:16.870
Cui,

13:17.390 --> 13:19.000
isn't it good to be a blacksmith?

13:19.000 --> 13:19.840
If you pick up

13:19.870 --> 13:21.320
this trade properly from Blacksmith Li,

13:21.320 --> 13:21.960
our future

13:21.960 --> 13:22.820
will be secure.

13:22.960 --> 13:24.020
Don't you think so?

13:45.630 --> 13:46.320
My Lady,

13:46.630 --> 13:47.750
I just heard something

13:47.750 --> 13:48.950
about Physician Jiu.

13:49.870 --> 13:50.470
What is it?

13:51.120 --> 13:53.180
Someone is setting him up with a girl.

13:59.870 --> 14:00.730
Physician Jiu,

14:00.970 --> 14:01.720
you may not know me,

14:01.720 --> 14:02.910
but I know you.

14:03.320 --> 14:04.510
I heard from Madam Wang that

14:04.510 --> 14:06.570
you're neither married nor engaged.

14:07.630 --> 14:09.720
You're already 24, not young anymore.

14:09.720 --> 14:10.790
I have a younger sister.

14:10.790 --> 14:11.510
She's 21,

14:12.030 --> 14:13.320
gentle, pretty,

14:13.910 --> 14:15.840
just not in good health.

14:16.550 --> 14:17.880
But you're a physician.

14:18.150 --> 14:19.680
Aren't you a perfect match?

14:19.730 --> 14:20.810
How about it?

14:23.880 --> 14:25.680
You might not know much about me.

14:25.720 --> 14:26.690
My husband is from the Cui family.

14:26.690 --> 14:27.750
He's a blacksmith,

14:27.840 --> 14:29.310
and his family is well-off.

14:29.310 --> 14:30.320
My sister

14:30.510 --> 14:32.240
is adept and efficient at work.

14:32.240 --> 14:34.370
She's definitely good enough for you.

14:34.790 --> 14:36.720
You once treated my mother-in-law,

14:36.720 --> 14:37.510
so our whole family

14:37.510 --> 14:38.840
knows you quite well.

14:39.200 --> 14:40.790
As for the rumor out there,

14:40.810 --> 14:42.080
saying that your five family members

14:42.080 --> 14:43.040
were all murdered,

14:43.040 --> 14:44.640
we don't believe that at all.

14:45.840 --> 14:47.480
You're a handsome and decent man.

14:47.480 --> 14:49.810
It's such a waste if you don't get married.

14:49.880 --> 14:51.140
If you're interested,

14:51.420 --> 14:52.880
I can bring her over

14:52.910 --> 14:54.140
this afternoon.

14:54.510 --> 14:55.390
If you two

14:55.390 --> 14:56.240
hit it off,

14:56.790 --> 14:57.870
I can immediately have someone

14:57.870 --> 14:58.870
arrange the wedding.

14:58.870 --> 15:00.320
You'll have a wife then.

15:03.540 --> 15:04.600
If he's marrying anyone, it's me,

15:04.600 --> 15:05.630
not your sister.

15:06.910 --> 15:07.570
Who are you?

15:08.000 --> 15:08.870
And who are you?

15:09.390 --> 15:10.870
I'm Physician Jiu's patient.

15:10.870 --> 15:12.480
I'm Physician Jiu's love.

15:14.310 --> 15:15.380
His love?

15:17.320 --> 15:18.790
Lady, you look so young,

15:18.790 --> 15:20.310
yet you're saying something

15:20.310 --> 15:21.160
so shameless?

15:23.150 --> 15:24.510
You haven't woken up from

15:24.510 --> 15:25.910
last night's dream, huh?

15:25.960 --> 15:28.760
You're the one who's still dreaming! Just ask him.

15:29.870 --> 15:30.730
Physician Jiu,

15:31.440 --> 15:32.900
this can't be true, right?

15:34.790 --> 15:35.870
I-It's true.

15:37.600 --> 15:40.060
But the constable said you weren't engaged.

15:41.270 --> 15:42.800
Well, it's happening soon.

15:46.210 --> 15:48.270
Sorry for not getting the full picture.

15:48.270 --> 15:48.870
Miss,

15:49.200 --> 15:50.200
I apologize.

15:53.300 --> 15:54.500
Here, your medicine.

15:54.720 --> 15:55.320
Thank you.

15:57.330 --> 15:57.930
Oh, right,

15:58.240 --> 16:00.700
decoct it at home based on the instructions.

16:00.750 --> 16:01.360
Okay.

16:02.220 --> 16:03.680
I'm not usually this rude.

16:11.550 --> 16:12.750
No wonder.

16:16.720 --> 16:18.410
Why do you sound so sarcastic?

16:19.390 --> 16:21.420
No wonder you don't want to be my boyfriend.

16:21.420 --> 16:22.350
Turns out you want to marry

16:22.350 --> 16:24.210
the blacksmith's family member.

16:26.630 --> 16:27.390
This sword of yours

16:27.390 --> 16:28.840
is a treasure.

16:28.840 --> 16:29.640
How can you...

16:33.840 --> 16:34.510
Xuanye.

16:36.250 --> 16:37.370
I-It's broken?

16:39.200 --> 16:39.670
It...

16:40.870 --> 16:42.840
I-It wasn't me, was it?

16:46.630 --> 16:47.600
Well, um...

16:50.180 --> 16:50.870
Xuanye,

16:51.240 --> 16:53.300
did you use the Real-felicity Sword?

16:58.800 --> 17:00.560
So this Real-felicity Sword

17:00.720 --> 17:01.850
is the fourth sword?

17:03.600 --> 17:06.310
There are five swords in total in the Hidden Dragon Case.

17:06.310 --> 17:07.470
You've only seen

17:07.510 --> 17:10.550
the Greedy Wolf, Mountain Shaker, and Fire Swords before.

17:10.550 --> 17:12.329
Actually, there are two more swords.

17:12.329 --> 17:14.609
They are Real-felicity and Origin-returning.

17:14.609 --> 17:16.200
But the way to draw these two swords

17:16.200 --> 17:17.130
is very special.

17:17.680 --> 17:19.680
So I've never drawn them out before.

17:19.859 --> 17:21.790
That's why you've never seen them.

17:22.250 --> 17:24.780
Just now, your touch on the Hidden Dragon Case

17:24.790 --> 17:25.670
caused a crack

17:25.750 --> 17:27.160
in its outer shell.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.890
This is the trace left behind

17:29.910 --> 17:31.510
after using the Real-felicity Sword.

17:31.510 --> 17:32.110
So,

17:32.880 --> 17:34.080
it's very likely that

17:34.350 --> 17:35.440
I've severed one

17:35.750 --> 17:37.680
of your causality relationships.

17:38.790 --> 17:40.480
Why did you sever one

17:41.090 --> 17:42.890
of my causality relationships?

17:43.070 --> 17:45.400
It's very likely that you ran into danger,

17:45.900 --> 17:47.750
and things were too complicated

17:47.780 --> 17:48.670
and severe

17:49.030 --> 17:50.000
for me to fix,

17:50.590 --> 17:52.520
so I used the Real-felicity Sword.

17:52.830 --> 17:54.590
But according to what you just said,

17:54.590 --> 17:55.310
you've never drawn

17:55.310 --> 17:57.160
the Real-felicity Sword before, right?

17:57.160 --> 17:58.220
My father said that

17:58.680 --> 18:01.000
in the Eight Pillar Sect, only the founder

18:01.000 --> 18:03.000
once drew the Real-felicity Sword.

18:03.030 --> 18:05.760
He said it was related to a celestial phenomenon,

18:05.920 --> 18:07.320
but I don't know which one

18:07.920 --> 18:08.750
exactly.

18:10.640 --> 18:11.720
That powerful?

18:14.720 --> 18:15.510
Hold on.

18:17.720 --> 18:18.960
When you used other swords before,

18:18.960 --> 18:20.560
there was always a backlash.

18:20.880 --> 18:22.110
Then what's the backlash

18:22.110 --> 18:22.790
of this one?

18:28.070 --> 18:28.920
Stand up now.

18:29.350 --> 18:30.160
Let me check.

18:36.890 --> 18:38.950
Causality is the greatest backlash.

18:39.200 --> 18:41.420
A single move can beget a chain reaction.

18:41.420 --> 18:42.130
Sometimes,

18:42.150 --> 18:43.280
a small change

18:43.510 --> 18:45.570
can overturn a person's entire life.

18:46.340 --> 18:48.300
Perhaps we have already lost

18:48.330 --> 18:49.790
something very important

18:49.880 --> 18:51.410
without even realizing it.

18:52.170 --> 18:54.260
Real-felicity, Real-felicity.

18:55.050 --> 18:56.800
No cause, no effect.

18:57.140 --> 18:59.340
Only then can one obtain real felicity.

18:59.860 --> 19:01.430
How unique this sword is.

19:07.100 --> 19:08.750
Have you two made up?

19:14.480 --> 19:15.930
If so, make me something to eat now.

19:15.930 --> 19:16.540
Banxia,

19:16.880 --> 19:17.720
Xuanye's cooking

19:17.720 --> 19:18.830
has caused me to lose

19:18.830 --> 19:20.630
quite a lot of weight these days!

19:22.460 --> 19:23.720
Who's made up with him?

19:24.650 --> 19:26.450
Guess you have to keep starving.

19:41.030 --> 19:42.410
It makes you feel much happier.

19:42.410 --> 19:43.000
Yes.

19:44.920 --> 19:46.650
What a brilliant performance.

19:57.090 --> 19:58.490
Is that musician on stage

19:58.750 --> 20:00.110
Mr. Bai, Bai Ning?

20:00.510 --> 20:01.160
Yes.

20:05.680 --> 20:07.010
Mr. Bai, please hold on.

20:07.160 --> 20:09.220
An esteemed guest wished to meet you.

20:09.240 --> 20:10.570
This is a greeting gift.

20:25.270 --> 20:26.070
Please enjoy.

20:29.810 --> 20:30.940
I'm fortunate today

20:31.400 --> 20:33.530
to have enjoyed your Qin performance.

20:33.790 --> 20:36.050
It was as clear and beautiful as pure jade

20:36.070 --> 20:37.270
and lotus dew.

20:38.450 --> 20:40.780
It deserves to be called "unparalleled."

20:41.160 --> 20:42.290
I'm flattered, sir.

20:42.730 --> 20:45.190
Actually, I don't know much about Qin music,

20:45.640 --> 20:48.030
but my master says your playing is fabulous.

20:48.030 --> 20:49.360
So it must be good.

20:50.110 --> 20:51.240
Your master?

20:52.940 --> 20:55.000
Qin Xuanzhi, Vice Minister of Rites.

20:57.480 --> 20:58.940
Mr. Bai, please don't be nervous.

20:58.940 --> 21:01.340
I'm here to ask you a favor this time.

21:02.070 --> 21:03.130
In half a month,

21:03.160 --> 21:05.220
there will be a royal poetry banquet.

21:05.530 --> 21:07.000
All the scholars who passed the imperial exam

21:07.000 --> 21:08.240
will attend it,

21:08.680 --> 21:11.920
where they'll compose poems and enjoy wine in front of flowers.

21:11.920 --> 21:12.650
At that time,

21:13.270 --> 21:15.550
His Majesty will also attend the banquet

21:15.960 --> 21:17.560
to pick talent for the state.

21:18.680 --> 21:21.510
With nice poems and fine wine,

21:22.440 --> 21:24.700
how could there be no good music to match?

21:26.000 --> 21:27.730
So His Majesty issued a decree,

21:27.880 --> 21:29.190
ordering my master

21:29.600 --> 21:32.000
to seek one of the best musicians of our time

21:33.480 --> 21:36.310
to play at the banquet.

21:36.980 --> 21:37.740
So

21:38.160 --> 21:39.160
you chose me?

21:40.640 --> 21:41.880
After this banquet,

21:42.240 --> 21:44.240
you will be His Majesty's musician.

21:45.130 --> 21:46.200
That means the world's

21:46.200 --> 21:48.240
top-class Qin master.

21:49.340 --> 21:50.750
I believe your name

21:51.000 --> 21:52.960
will be well-known

21:52.980 --> 21:54.540
to literally everyone

21:54.750 --> 21:55.750
who plays the Qin.

22:09.140 --> 22:09.800
Madam Tang.

22:10.440 --> 22:11.200
Xuanye.

22:14.100 --> 22:15.300
Is Mr. Duan at home?

22:16.730 --> 22:17.400
Mr. Duan,

22:17.950 --> 22:19.150
I've changed my mind.

22:19.790 --> 22:21.590
Banxia still needs to be with me.

22:26.160 --> 22:27.590
You already promised me.

22:28.750 --> 22:29.240
Yes,

22:29.880 --> 22:30.590
I know

22:31.270 --> 22:33.330
you don't want Banxia to be in danger.

22:33.420 --> 22:34.680
But this is exactly why

22:35.120 --> 22:36.320
I can't leave her.

22:37.030 --> 22:37.750
Why?

22:39.180 --> 22:40.240
I agreed

22:40.270 --> 22:41.130
to leave Banxia

22:41.480 --> 22:42.160
because

22:43.520 --> 22:45.120
I thought if I wasn't around,

22:45.310 --> 22:46.840
she would be safe and sound,

22:46.880 --> 22:48.280
not disturbed by demons.

22:48.880 --> 22:50.210
But now it turns out that

22:50.310 --> 22:51.110
I was wrong.

22:52.200 --> 22:54.480
You're well aware of Banxia's constitution.

22:54.480 --> 22:55.340
And as you know,

22:55.750 --> 22:56.350
when you two

22:56.350 --> 22:57.510
were missing,

22:58.160 --> 22:59.550
Banxia went through a lot,

22:59.550 --> 23:01.030
like hardships and dangers.

23:01.030 --> 23:01.830
Now she's even

23:01.830 --> 23:03.430
more susceptible to demons.

23:06.590 --> 23:08.250
So after much consideration,

23:08.640 --> 23:09.510
I still think

23:10.590 --> 23:11.790
it's safer for Banxia

23:12.030 --> 23:12.960
to stay with me.

23:17.200 --> 23:18.480
I am a demon hunter

23:18.960 --> 23:20.350
who messes with demons frequently.

23:20.350 --> 23:21.080
That's true.

23:21.480 --> 23:22.740
But that's exactly why

23:23.270 --> 23:25.200
I am the one who can protect Banxia.

23:32.790 --> 23:35.100
You saved my life. There's no need to kneel before me.

23:35.100 --> 23:36.340
You are Banxia's father,

23:36.340 --> 23:37.870
so of course I should kneel.

23:43.440 --> 23:44.880
I swear on my life that

23:45.480 --> 23:46.940
as long as I'm still alive,

23:47.040 --> 23:48.000
I'm not letting anyone

23:48.000 --> 23:49.240
lay a finger on Banxia.

23:49.240 --> 23:52.700
I'll use every last one of my faculties to protect her for life.

23:54.110 --> 23:55.170
So, Mr. Duan, I hope

23:55.590 --> 23:57.990
you will allow Banxia and me to be together.

24:18.680 --> 24:19.310
Sir.

24:20.070 --> 24:20.870
Welcome back.

24:22.520 --> 24:24.790
Someone was looking for you at Liushui Pavilion today.

24:24.790 --> 24:26.650
Would you care to guess who it was?

24:29.380 --> 24:30.140
It was

24:30.510 --> 24:33.180
the butler of Vice Minister Qin from the Ministry of Rites.

24:33.180 --> 24:33.920
He said

24:33.960 --> 24:34.830
Vice Minister Qin has long

24:34.830 --> 24:36.920
admired your Qin playing.

24:37.680 --> 24:40.160
He'd like to invite you to a poetry banquet

24:40.270 --> 24:41.800
to perform for His Majesty.

24:45.310 --> 24:46.070
Sir,

24:47.240 --> 24:48.310
you don't want to?

24:51.160 --> 24:53.180
Spending my days making tea, playing the Qin,

24:53.180 --> 24:54.400
seeing the one I care about,

24:54.400 --> 24:55.490
and living a peaceful life

24:55.490 --> 24:56.930
is already a blessing.

24:57.640 --> 24:59.300
The bustling and fancy Shendu

24:59.550 --> 25:00.720
isn't a place for me.

25:01.510 --> 25:02.070
But you

25:02.070 --> 25:04.070
have never been to Shendu, have you?

25:04.120 --> 25:06.650
I may not have been there, but I've heard about it.

25:06.650 --> 25:08.440
Shendu does abound

25:08.530 --> 25:09.720
with masters and talent.

25:09.720 --> 25:11.240
There, you'll find way more people

25:11.240 --> 25:13.970
who understand music and rhythm than in Guangping.

25:13.970 --> 25:16.440
However, those who truly listen with their hearts

25:16.440 --> 25:17.560
are very few.

25:17.590 --> 25:18.850
Because in that place,

25:19.240 --> 25:21.020
no matter how outstanding one's Qin playing is,

25:21.020 --> 25:22.240
it's no more than a tool for the powerful

25:22.240 --> 25:24.100
to show off their cultured taste.

25:24.720 --> 25:25.590
B-But...

25:28.680 --> 25:30.140
You really want to go, huh?

25:31.000 --> 25:31.790
No way.

25:33.240 --> 25:35.570
You're the one they're inviting, Mr. Bai.

25:35.750 --> 25:37.280
It has nothing to do with me.

25:37.880 --> 25:38.790
Moreover,

25:39.330 --> 25:40.370
my playing

25:40.880 --> 25:43.340
is nowhere near qualified for that banquet.

25:43.810 --> 25:45.610
I just find it such a pity for you.

25:45.950 --> 25:47.270
I-It'd be such a shame

25:47.290 --> 25:48.820
to give up this opportunity

25:49.610 --> 25:51.140
to make a name for yourself.

25:53.590 --> 25:54.790
If your love for the Qin is real,

25:54.790 --> 25:55.920
you should know that

25:56.070 --> 25:58.600
living peacefully and playing the Qin freely

25:59.480 --> 26:01.940
matters much more than fame and reputation.

26:02.300 --> 26:03.430
Starting tomorrow,

26:03.650 --> 26:05.250
I'll go to Liushui Pavilion.

26:06.070 --> 26:07.110
Have a good rest.

26:10.470 --> 26:11.230
Yes.

26:50.160 --> 26:50.720
Sir.

26:52.330 --> 26:53.790
If there's anything you'd like to eat

26:53.790 --> 26:54.640
or have,

26:54.720 --> 26:56.000
you can tell me in advance,

26:56.000 --> 26:57.830
and I'll bring it for you when I return.

26:57.830 --> 26:58.680
I want nothing.

26:58.680 --> 26:59.540
Thank you, sir.

27:01.590 --> 27:03.030
I've thought it over carefully.

27:03.030 --> 27:04.720
You're right, sir.

27:05.070 --> 27:07.130
My mind's been flooded with distractions.

27:07.130 --> 27:07.790
Now I should

27:07.800 --> 27:09.530
focus on honing my Qin playing.

27:12.310 --> 27:13.880
Take care on your journey, sir.

27:13.880 --> 27:15.610
I'll stay and won't see you off.

27:16.230 --> 27:16.790
Okay.

27:29.480 --> 27:31.030
I haven't eaten for two days,

27:31.030 --> 27:32.300
yet I haven't lost any weight at all.

27:32.300 --> 27:33.900
I can only eat some pears now.

27:34.880 --> 27:36.740
How can you not have a proper meal?

27:37.650 --> 27:38.610
No matter what,

27:38.640 --> 27:39.730
you should at least eat properly.

27:39.730 --> 27:40.920
It'll be bad if you mess up

27:40.920 --> 27:41.680
your health.

27:42.400 --> 27:43.290
Honestly, I've always

27:43.290 --> 27:45.620
thought you look great the way you are now.

27:46.000 --> 27:47.400
If you get skinnier,

27:49.400 --> 27:51.000
you won't be as cute anymore.

28:01.450 --> 28:01.930
Banxia,

28:02.590 --> 28:04.240
that Matchmaking Tree is really famous.

28:04.240 --> 28:07.190
[Blessing and Fortune]

28:04.680 --> 28:05.830
Let's go take a look.

28:34.850 --> 28:35.370
Banxia,

28:35.400 --> 28:36.830
let's go draw a fortune stick.

28:36.830 --> 28:37.750
You go ahead.

28:38.310 --> 28:40.170
I think I see an old acquaintance.

28:44.880 --> 28:46.340
Then come and join me soon.

28:52.110 --> 28:53.110
Greetings, lady.

28:54.160 --> 28:55.250
We meet again.

28:55.750 --> 28:57.410
Are you here for a divination?

28:57.590 --> 28:59.120
Why are you still here, sir?

29:01.160 --> 29:02.680
After getting out of the painting,

29:02.680 --> 29:04.140
I returned to Mount Bodhi.

29:04.310 --> 29:07.000
The mountain is still the same, but the Taoist temple is gone.

29:07.000 --> 29:08.660
I didn't see my master either.

29:08.750 --> 29:11.550
It's said that a flash flood occurred 60 years ago,

29:11.720 --> 29:12.980
crushing everything.

29:15.000 --> 29:16.550
Then what's your plan?

29:17.070 --> 29:18.980
The time spent inside the painting can't be retrieved.

29:18.980 --> 29:20.180
When you got out of it,

29:20.200 --> 29:22.400
your family and friends were also gone.

29:22.510 --> 29:25.200
Time flies, bringing vicissitudes.

29:25.750 --> 29:27.680
Everything in the world unfolds

29:27.680 --> 29:28.940
based on natural laws.

29:29.000 --> 29:29.880
I am merely

29:29.900 --> 29:31.400
following these laws.

29:31.830 --> 29:33.230
Please have a seat, lady.

29:36.840 --> 29:38.240
Don't be sad, lady.

29:38.390 --> 29:39.830
Now that fate has let us meet again,

29:39.830 --> 29:41.640
let me do a divination for you.

29:49.590 --> 29:52.520
Think of something and repeat it 3 times in your mind.

29:59.070 --> 30:02.400
Initial nine, plain shoes, going forward with no disaster.

30:02.620 --> 30:04.220
Judging from this hexagram,

30:05.240 --> 30:06.480
your concerns

30:07.200 --> 30:10.130
can only be resolved through sincerity and honesty.

30:15.110 --> 30:16.840
This divination is about fate,

30:16.850 --> 30:17.760
not for money.

30:18.350 --> 30:19.240
Please

30:19.690 --> 30:21.210
take it back, lady.

30:23.880 --> 30:24.440
Okay.

30:25.550 --> 30:27.550
Then if you need any help in the future,

30:27.550 --> 30:29.510
you can find me at the mansion next to

30:29.510 --> 30:31.160
the Ganshan Clinic, Sifang Street.

30:31.160 --> 30:32.030
I live there.

30:32.680 --> 30:34.590
Please don't worry about

30:35.000 --> 30:36.720
or feel sorry for me, lady.

30:37.720 --> 30:38.920
Though the real world

30:39.200 --> 30:40.510
is not as good as the fake one

30:40.510 --> 30:41.720
inside that painting,

30:41.720 --> 30:43.400
it makes me feel alive,

30:44.100 --> 30:46.100
fulfilled, proud,

30:46.270 --> 30:47.850
and full of spirit.

30:53.110 --> 30:53.590
Master,

30:54.450 --> 30:56.710
could you interpret this fortune stick?

31:01.960 --> 31:03.350
Thank you for your offer, sir.

31:03.350 --> 31:05.240
I'm willing to go with you to Shendu.

31:05.240 --> 31:07.040
Only hope my humble Qin playing

31:07.070 --> 31:07.680
is good enough

31:07.680 --> 31:09.380
to please the nobles in Shendu.

31:09.380 --> 31:11.240
Mr. Bai, you're being too modest.

31:11.750 --> 31:13.160
When you rise to fame in the future,

31:13.160 --> 31:15.020
hope I can ride on your coattails.

31:15.160 --> 31:16.170
So, sir,

31:16.640 --> 31:19.190
please don't forget about my help after you succeed.

31:19.190 --> 31:20.390
Please rest assured.

31:20.490 --> 31:22.280
If I make it one day,

31:22.360 --> 31:23.480
I'll surely repay you for recognizing

31:23.480 --> 31:24.270
my talents.

31:25.430 --> 31:26.810
Since we've come to an agreement,

31:26.810 --> 31:27.720
then I'll head back

31:27.720 --> 31:29.080
to the capital in 3 days.

31:29.290 --> 31:31.560
I'll be waiting for you

31:31.590 --> 31:33.000
at the city gate, Mr. Bai.

31:33.200 --> 31:33.930
Is that okay?

31:34.070 --> 31:34.920
Three days?

31:35.240 --> 31:36.040
What's wrong?

31:36.460 --> 31:37.410
Mr. Bai,

31:37.530 --> 31:40.460
do you have any family members who need to be settled?

31:40.620 --> 31:41.680
If that's the case,

31:42.060 --> 31:43.830
I can also push it back for a few days

31:43.830 --> 31:44.880
for your sake.

31:45.510 --> 31:46.110
It's okay.

31:47.000 --> 31:47.800
Just in 3 days.

31:50.890 --> 31:53.150
Watch where you're going! Are you blind?

31:53.980 --> 31:54.770
I'm sorry.

31:55.310 --> 31:56.440
Is "sorry" all it takes?

31:56.440 --> 31:57.400
The road is super wide,

31:57.400 --> 31:59.000
yet you still bumped into me?

31:59.350 --> 32:00.280
I'm truly sorry.

32:02.240 --> 32:02.900
Now tell me.

32:03.040 --> 32:04.330
How are you going to compensate me?

32:04.330 --> 32:05.160
You were the one

32:05.160 --> 32:06.940
who wasn't watching where you were going.

32:06.940 --> 32:07.430
How come now

32:07.430 --> 32:08.760
you're blaming others?

32:11.110 --> 32:12.440
Mind your own business.

32:18.590 --> 32:20.110
Thank you, Mr. Bai,

32:20.200 --> 32:21.340
for your help today.

32:21.790 --> 32:22.790
Don't mention it.

32:22.960 --> 32:24.420
You also helped me before.

32:29.790 --> 32:30.720
Forget about it.

32:31.640 --> 32:32.850
I didn't expect

32:32.880 --> 32:34.420
to run into you here today.

32:34.840 --> 32:36.080
Life is full

32:36.220 --> 32:37.420
of surprises.

32:38.110 --> 32:38.720
Indeed,

32:39.630 --> 32:41.890
the surprising and ever-changing life.

32:43.590 --> 32:44.360
That's why

32:44.920 --> 32:46.280
we should seek

32:46.320 --> 32:47.750
divination for guidance

32:47.780 --> 32:48.980
when we're confused.

32:49.010 --> 32:50.270
You just happened to hear

32:50.270 --> 32:52.530
the divination you wanted to hear today.

32:53.440 --> 32:55.160
It's better to rely on yourself than others.

32:55.160 --> 32:56.110
In life,

32:56.270 --> 32:56.960
one must know

32:56.960 --> 32:58.620
what they really want, right?

32:59.240 --> 33:00.160
That's true.

33:01.080 --> 33:02.310
But we should also learn to

33:02.310 --> 33:03.910
be content with what we have.

33:04.220 --> 33:05.320
Today, that old friend of mine

33:05.320 --> 33:06.320
also told me that

33:06.680 --> 33:08.400
with honesty and sincerity,

33:08.420 --> 33:10.420
there's nothing you can't get over.

33:10.790 --> 33:11.640
You're right.

33:11.910 --> 33:12.720
No sincerity

33:12.750 --> 33:14.280
is the most terrible thing.

33:15.810 --> 33:17.040
Life is short.

33:17.480 --> 33:18.740
Live it to the fullest;

33:19.240 --> 33:20.570
don't waste your youth.

33:21.880 --> 33:22.410
Alright,

33:22.510 --> 33:23.970
it's time for me to go back.

33:24.700 --> 33:25.760
I'll take my leave.

33:29.270 --> 33:30.130
See you around.

33:31.300 --> 33:32.150
We'll go to Liushui Pavilion

33:32.150 --> 33:33.480
for music if we're free.

33:34.200 --> 33:36.260
Then I'll look forward to your visit.

34:02.960 --> 34:04.470
-Madam.
-Madam.

34:06.910 --> 34:07.570
Be careful.

34:09.840 --> 34:11.150
I stepped on my dress.

34:12.590 --> 34:13.389
Bodhisattva!

34:14.150 --> 34:15.949
The Bodhisattva's manifested!

34:17.480 --> 34:18.800
Madam, you're pregnant

34:18.800 --> 34:20.000
and can easily get tired.

34:20.000 --> 34:21.360
A long tour is too much for you.

34:21.360 --> 34:22.360
Actually, Madam,

34:22.360 --> 34:24.020
as long as you pray sincerely,

34:24.110 --> 34:25.909
even if you don't come in person,

34:26.030 --> 34:27.630
the gods will still hear you.

34:29.429 --> 34:31.230
Madam, please rest well for the baby's sake.

34:31.230 --> 34:33.090
And you will have a safe delivery.

34:35.020 --> 34:35.980
Thank you, sir.

35:41.680 --> 35:42.870
I've long heard that Fa'en Temple

35:42.870 --> 35:45.670
is bustling with believers and grants all wishes.

35:45.960 --> 35:47.480
So it's you, sir, fulfilling

35:47.480 --> 35:49.140
people's wishes for the gods.

35:49.440 --> 35:50.670
My real name is Chilian.

35:50.670 --> 35:52.010
I was blessed by the Bodhisattva,

35:52.010 --> 35:54.630
luckily obtaining a primordial spirit and consciousness.

35:54.630 --> 35:55.810
Since I took human form,

35:55.810 --> 35:57.110
I've naturally stayed here

35:57.110 --> 35:58.040
to serve the gods

35:58.230 --> 35:59.690
and repay their kindness.

36:01.180 --> 36:02.180
How dare you,

36:02.710 --> 36:04.840
a mere demon, act on behalf of the gods?

36:04.840 --> 36:07.590
Mortals with good intentions can also accumulate virtue and do good deeds.

36:07.590 --> 36:08.650
Though I am a demon,

36:08.950 --> 36:11.320
I dare say my abilities surpass those of ordinary humans.

36:11.320 --> 36:14.250
I have intentions to do good, to save and help people.

36:14.390 --> 36:15.720
What's wrong with that?

36:17.480 --> 36:18.030
Yeah,

36:18.970 --> 36:19.630
if one's sincerely

36:19.630 --> 36:20.830
trying to help people

36:21.040 --> 36:22.370
and accumulate virtue,

36:22.440 --> 36:23.320
then even a demon

36:23.320 --> 36:24.980
can do good deeds for the gods.

36:25.760 --> 36:26.680
But what if

36:26.710 --> 36:29.440
it's someone whose hands are stained with blood?

36:33.640 --> 36:34.900
Zhang Pu and Lv Sanlang

36:34.920 --> 36:37.050
were both killed by you, weren't they?

36:40.920 --> 36:42.470
Guanyin Bodhisattva is merciful,

36:42.470 --> 36:44.640
shedding tears of compassion for people.

36:44.640 --> 36:46.280
Her followers are spread across the land.

36:46.280 --> 36:47.880
Xingxian is one of them.

36:50.480 --> 36:51.030
I heard about

36:51.030 --> 36:52.430
Xingxian's tragic life.

36:52.590 --> 36:53.920
Without anyone to rely on,

36:53.920 --> 36:55.020
she could only turn to the gods

36:55.020 --> 36:56.680
telling them her grievances.

36:57.000 --> 36:57.760
And you

36:58.430 --> 36:59.460
heard her prayer

36:59.480 --> 37:00.230
right here,

37:00.840 --> 37:01.500
didn't you?

37:05.150 --> 37:08.080
I was simply fulfilling wishes on behalf of the gods.

37:08.890 --> 37:09.560
Numerous people

37:09.560 --> 37:11.340
have come to Fa'en Temple to pray.

37:11.340 --> 37:12.510
Only those with good intentions

37:12.510 --> 37:14.310
have had their wishes come true,

37:14.590 --> 37:16.520
not the ones with evil intentions.

37:17.300 --> 37:18.300
I just want to know

37:19.090 --> 37:20.490
why you made an exception

37:20.530 --> 37:21.610
for Xingxian only.

37:22.710 --> 37:23.400
I don't care about

37:23.400 --> 37:24.530
your relationship.

37:25.670 --> 37:27.840
But it's never right to kill people.

37:28.710 --> 37:30.110
You've crossed the line.

37:30.710 --> 37:33.440
There are no boundaries between good and evil in this world.

37:33.440 --> 37:36.060
So there should be no such thing as "crossing the line."

37:36.060 --> 37:38.710
You humans often say, "What goes around comes around."

37:38.710 --> 37:39.550
That Zhang Pu

37:40.070 --> 37:42.590
was addicted to alcohol and beating his wife.

37:42.590 --> 37:43.590
Wasn't that evil?

37:44.600 --> 37:46.150
Lv Sanlang was greedy and lecherous,

37:46.150 --> 37:47.110
abusing women.

37:47.550 --> 37:48.800
Wasn't that evil too?

37:49.880 --> 37:51.010
That being the case,

37:51.380 --> 37:54.180
what's wrong with me punishing those scoundrels?

37:55.290 --> 37:57.880
Punishing evil and doing good is not wrong in itself.

37:57.880 --> 37:58.880
The real problem

37:59.280 --> 38:01.510
is your way of fighting evil with more evil.

38:01.510 --> 38:02.640
In the mortal world,

38:02.710 --> 38:04.230
there are rules and laws.

38:04.670 --> 38:06.070
To punish those evil guys,

38:06.070 --> 38:07.000
you used sorcery

38:07.360 --> 38:08.620
and committed murder.

38:10.320 --> 38:11.380
I'm a demon hunter.

38:12.150 --> 38:13.350
I only know one thing—

38:14.070 --> 38:15.880
once a demon kills a human,

38:16.230 --> 38:17.490
it cannot be forgiven.

38:17.760 --> 38:19.110
You do it once,

38:19.360 --> 38:20.690
and you can't hold back.

38:21.710 --> 38:23.840
It'll happen again,

38:24.510 --> 38:26.630
maybe tens of thousands of times.

38:27.150 --> 38:29.440
Now you've made an exception and killed them for Xingxian.

38:29.440 --> 38:30.640
What about next time?

38:31.440 --> 38:32.230
If Xingxian has

38:32.230 --> 38:33.030
other wishes,

38:33.550 --> 38:34.480
what will you do?

38:35.670 --> 38:37.130
How far will you go for her?

38:37.880 --> 38:38.480
I know

38:39.280 --> 38:41.010
snake slough can reshape bones

38:41.130 --> 38:42.790
and change one's appearance.

38:43.770 --> 38:45.190
The substitute you've been hiding

38:45.190 --> 38:46.000
at home

38:46.690 --> 38:47.820
is Xingxian, right?

38:48.400 --> 38:50.660
She's innocent. Don't you dare hurt her.

38:52.510 --> 38:53.550
Considering the good deeds you did

38:53.550 --> 38:54.880
and the lives you saved,

38:55.320 --> 38:56.380
I won't do anything

38:56.760 --> 38:57.560
to both of you.

38:58.980 --> 39:00.510
But there's one condition.

39:02.070 --> 39:03.730
I want you to leave Guangping,

39:03.840 --> 39:04.920
never coming back,

39:05.590 --> 39:06.440
and swear that

39:07.010 --> 39:07.960
you will never kill

39:07.960 --> 39:09.070
anyone again.

39:32.900 --> 39:33.940
In a few days,

39:34.190 --> 39:35.790
I will be leaving Guangping.

39:38.340 --> 39:40.590
I didn't have time to prepare much today.

39:40.590 --> 39:42.500
So I'll raise this cup of tea instead of wine

39:42.500 --> 39:43.700
as a toast to you, sir.

39:45.100 --> 39:46.370
Thank you for saving me

39:47.270 --> 39:49.280
and giving me a second chance at life.

39:49.280 --> 39:50.340
Were it not for you,

39:50.510 --> 39:51.340
I'm afraid I would still

39:51.340 --> 39:52.690
be locked up and beaten

39:52.710 --> 39:53.910
by Zhang Pu every day,

39:54.070 --> 39:55.600
with no hope for better days

39:57.150 --> 39:58.150
or a chance to see

39:58.730 --> 40:00.170
such a vast world.

40:01.230 --> 40:01.800
Sir,

40:03.030 --> 40:04.030
thank you so much.

40:09.620 --> 40:11.080
Do you plan to go to Shendu?

40:12.700 --> 40:14.270
Shendu is the capital,

40:14.700 --> 40:16.700
prosperous but extravagant.

40:17.680 --> 40:19.230
Be it food, clothing, or other daily necessities,

40:19.230 --> 40:21.030
everything there is expensive.

40:21.510 --> 40:23.020
I've heard that even paper there

40:23.020 --> 40:24.690
is pricier than elsewhere.

40:26.400 --> 40:27.920
I wanted to go before

40:28.670 --> 40:30.110
because Mr. Gu

40:30.320 --> 40:32.520
said he'd recommend you to His Majesty.

40:32.840 --> 40:33.760
I thought it was

40:33.780 --> 40:35.840
a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

40:36.280 --> 40:37.820
But on second thought,

40:38.840 --> 40:40.550
it's really not necessary.

40:42.000 --> 40:44.670
Sir, you are such a pure, kind-hearted person

40:45.150 --> 40:46.750
with virtues and integrity,

40:46.960 --> 40:48.820
like no one else.

40:49.320 --> 40:50.550
You really shouldn't be tainted

40:50.550 --> 40:51.760
by the fame or fortune

40:51.760 --> 40:53.020
of this corrupt world.

40:54.550 --> 40:55.150
Good.

40:55.760 --> 40:57.850
I'm also thinking of visiting Jiangnan.

40:57.850 --> 41:00.160
Perhaps we could travel together.

41:03.960 --> 41:04.710
Didn't you

41:05.230 --> 41:06.690
want to stay in Guangping?

41:09.400 --> 41:11.320
Things can change.

41:12.510 --> 41:13.630
Now, my fate with Guangping

41:13.630 --> 41:14.630
has come to an end.

41:15.550 --> 41:16.800
It's time to leave.

41:17.440 --> 41:17.930
But...

41:17.960 --> 41:19.400
I know your concerns.

41:19.840 --> 41:21.210
But I'm not leaving Guangping

41:21.210 --> 41:22.130
because of you.

41:23.710 --> 41:25.110
There's another reason.

41:26.760 --> 41:27.550
Another

41:29.040 --> 41:29.790
reason?

41:30.030 --> 41:31.160
I've made up my mind.

41:31.880 --> 41:33.520
Instead of being stuck in this tiny corner of the world

41:33.520 --> 41:34.920
and holding myself back,

41:35.120 --> 41:36.480
why not travel around the world

41:36.480 --> 41:37.810
to broaden my horizons?

41:38.480 --> 41:39.550
I happen to know

41:39.920 --> 41:41.780
several Qin masters in Jiangnan.

41:41.960 --> 41:42.800
Perhaps we

41:43.440 --> 41:44.700
could pay them a visit.

41:45.440 --> 41:47.480
If we get tired of our stay in Jiangnan,

41:47.480 --> 41:48.880
we can go to Qingzhou next

41:49.190 --> 41:51.250
to see the floating flowers in March.

41:51.760 --> 41:53.630
Or we could head for the frontier

41:54.330 --> 41:56.840
to see the long, straight smoke in the vast desert.

41:56.840 --> 41:57.840
Anyway,

41:58.480 --> 41:59.740
let's leave this place

41:59.800 --> 42:01.860
to lead a completely different life.

42:02.080 --> 42:03.080
Let more people

42:03.100 --> 42:04.160
hear our Qin music.

42:04.600 --> 42:06.200
Wouldn't that be wonderful?

42:07.920 --> 42:08.920
What do you think?

42:09.960 --> 42:11.150
It's up to you.

42:13.960 --> 42:14.490
Alright.

42:15.280 --> 42:16.360
Then let's pack up

42:16.480 --> 42:17.670
and set off in 2 days.
